        "original_id": "3a2c1bfb-cec3-5e37-a9c8-452af826dbf4",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Places: Marquette County, Michigan; Brainerd, Minnesota; Crow Wing County, Minnesota; K.I. Sawyer AFB; Sands Plains area\n- Products: Sawyer International Airport; Brainerd Lakes Regional Airport; M-553\n- Organizations: US Air Force\n\nFacts:\n- Sawyer International Airport is a county-owned public-use airport in Marquette County, Michigan, United States.\n- Brainerd Lakes Regional Airport is a public-use airport located three nautical miles northeast of the central business district of Brainerd in Crow Wing County, Minnesota, United States.\n- M-553 connects Marquette with Sawyer International Airport at the unincorporated community of K.I. Sawyer AFB in the Sands Plains area of Marquette County.\n- K.I. Sawyer AFB is the former site of a US Air Force base.",
